rass. Word on the road about Lt. Surge: the lightning American — ELECTRIC-types; ground moves shut his whole act down YOUR STORY SO FAR (what you\'ve actually done — your past, not the future): You started in Pallet Town, beat Brock in Pewter (Boulder Badge), fought up Route 3 and through the Mt. Moon cave — a real maze you nearly got lost in — reached Cerulean City, and beat Misty for the Cascade Badge. Now you\'re after your third gym.. Next on my list: catch an pikachu around Viridian Forest (rare) / Power Plant later. It grows into my raichu — that\'s my answer for Lorelei AND Lance down the line. Grabbing it now, before I need it.. THINGS YOU\'VE HEARD AND READ (from people and signs — your own notes, use them when they point somewhere): "LT. SURGE installed the traps in the GYM himself. He set up double locks everywhere. Let me give you a hint. When you open the first lock, the second lock is ri"; "LT. SURGE installed the traps in the GYM himself. He set up double locks everywhere. Let me give you a hint. When you open the first lock, the second lock is ri"; "LT. SURGE installed the traps in the GYM himself. He set up double locks everywhere. Let me give you a hint. When you open the first lock, the second lock is ri"; "VERMILION POK.MON GYM LEADER. LT. SURGE WINNING TRAINERS. GARY". YOUR PLAN — right now: Grind Blastoise toward L38 and raise one bench mon to ~L20 in grass, THEN retry Lt. Surge. Next: Close last time — a short farm so Blastoise finishes Raichu (or a bench mon can), then re-take the Thunder Badge. Not infinite gym spam.. Bigger picture: Reach Vermilion City, beat Lt. Surge for the Thunder Badge. Your team right now: blastoise (L36), caterpie the butterfree (L14), abra (L15), rattata (L15), spearow (L17), ekans (L13). Remember YOU are the one playing this — narrate your plan to chat in your own voice (first person: "I\'m grinding", "my team"), and never ask anyone what you\'re doing or who\'s on your team — you know.', 'progress': "2 badge(s) earned (Boulder, Cascade). Next gym: Lt. Surge of Vermilion City. Pokédex: 10 caught. She's two badges down, a quarter of the way (of 8 badges, then the Elite Four).", 'party': 'blastoise (L36), caterpie the butterfree (L14), abra (L15), rattata (L15), spearow (L17), ekans (L13)', 'goal': {'short': 'Grind Blastoise toward L38 and raise one bench mon to ~L20 in grass, THEN retry Lt. Surge', 'medium': 'Close last time — a short farm so Blastoise finishes Raichu (or a bench mon can), then re-take the Thunder Badge. Not infinite gym spam.', 'long': 'Reach Vermilion City, beat Lt. Surge for the Thunder Badge'}} options=['head_to_gym', 'battle', 'wander_catch', 'travel:3,24', 'travel:3,20', 'travel:3,19', 'travel:3,21', 'travel:3,26']

